{"format_version":2,"id":"18dc8810f0eeb438284dcd2493d64304ac0061751dd9c299","commits":["008624f9287868af12f51a0ddd8f2599bd965c1a","94a48cdfb02b84189eaef181722ae3fe8c8c24fc","aa9cf2d75596d4d84ce5c72874fc741bf9c4f2a3","7efd9b68a4755bde5ce64edccd09e9ceb3f97b37"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Breaking.** `release init` scaffolds `bump = \"\"` (was `\"patch\"`) and `release retry` scaffolds `ref = \"\"` (was the tag). Both fields must now be set explicitly. Scaffolded files include explanatory TOML comments.","type":"breaking"}
{"format_version":2,"id":"18dc8810f0efb7eb191959fb149847abb2d3fef32137dea1","commits":["82f484c87a6893548cd9e4919960287becd54974"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**New flag.** `watch --run-id` monitors CI runs by ID instead of commit SHA. Accepts multiple values (`--run-id 123 --run-id 456`). Mutually exclusive with the SHA positional arg.","type":"feature"}
{"format_version":2,"id":"18dc8810f0f06c907f3c4da3e2fe405bb9499317f1588307","commits":["7a31db5a7ae82d2a097d667f72a823148a375ea4"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Retry + watch integration.** `release retry` now captures dispatched workflow run IDs and passes them to `watch --run-id`, so monitoring works correctly even when the dispatch ref differs from the release tag.","type":"feature"}
{"format_version":2,"id":"18dc8810f0f0e5365d8330a16a4441b98cf9412d6b23f9c8","commits":["870307a5071734cc1ff4fa7e03fd7d40e6e1df72","de6a123ef4dd82526a6e75046ccddb24a7d94e76"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**CI sync rewrite.** Monorepo CI sync transforms rewritten from text-based to structured YAML (ruamel.yaml round-trip mode). `working-directory` is now injected per-job (not workflow-level), correctly handling cross-project CI workflows.","type":"feature"}
{"format_version":2,"id":"18dc8810f0f14e7251001cb719144ac7a58cd4b26e8285cc","commits":["22f4e29f588720a0a4f4f61aa269d8f14d29cadb"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Monorepo scoping.** `status` and `unreleased` now filter commits by project directory in monorepo mode, showing only commits that touch the current project's files.","type":"feature"}
{"format_version":2,"id":"18dc8810f0f1aace8d2955de098d4f98b73d9cdded3c7d57","commits":["0e5a96ab3fd3242df13cc5820742b4e0817df30d","020e8bf7c2576b5717550d2ba225759f1a193532"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Fix.** `changelog add` in monorepo sub-projects no longer writes to the root JSONL file. Path resolution uses explicit project root instead of CWD.","type":"fix"}
{"format_version":2,"id":"18dc8810f0f215ccd25bcd632eda41b5ba645876101b032a","commits":["49fb371667c0764091666889c8eca45a3bf58fbb","5816577b23a0dd3de9e2cb69bdcfd1123e0a4630","e162663f364da9ca797177819041edf1a8e6d70b","daf2e3d4dbb3e27b09a3e52316d457536e57f119"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Fix.** Config reads (`push_timeout`, publish config, deploy config, etc.) no longer fail silently after CWD shifts during monorepo releases. All config functions accept explicit `project_root`.","type":"fix"}
